objective: |
  Mix: navitrack-mobile-apps visual system (Logo, glass, AppHeader sheet, motion) + customer structured IA
  (full-bleed welcome, home tile grid, product catalog, report intro). Brand stays NaviTrack — no ESCORT clone.
  Now: one real BLE fuel sensor path. Catalog UI must scale to many models later (disabled/placeholders OK).
  No fleet GPS setup, no cloud personal account, no RS-485 in this sprint (tabs may show BT-only or hide RS-485).
  HARD RULE: Vitest + `bun run test`; FakeBle/MSW. CLOSEOUT: TQ.
  Planning complete (intake #1–#3). Awaiting scope-approved before gate OPEN / execution.

